data: {"id": "18aa4bf956524d4f-thinking-parallel_evidence-2317", "run_id": "18aa4bf956524d4f", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 生命周期状态**：\n   - kubectl_describe 显示 `status: Pending`，容器 `app` 状态为 `Waiting`，原因 `ContainerCreating`，Restart Count=0。\n   - Prometheus metrics (`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason`) 同样确认 `reason=\"ContainerCreating\"` 且值为 1；`kube_pod_status_phase` 显示 phase 为 `Pending=1`，`Running=0`。\n\n2. **关键事件（Events）**：\n   - **`FailedMount`**（83s，重复 35 次，持续 56 分钟）：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`\n   - **`FailedMount`**（11m，重复 20 次，持续 54", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788771912335, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

