data: {"id": "18aa4bf956524d4f-final", "run_id": "18aa4bf956524d4f", "seq": 2322, "ts_ms": 1788771931984, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz stuck in ContainerCreating (Pending phase) |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` 状态 `Pending` (fact-2d5e6a4b0a34) | 确认 Pod 处于不可用状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount` 事件：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (fact-5d6b4ddbd710) | 确认挂载失败及缺失资源 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `timed out waiting for the condition` 持续等待挂载 (fact-ee00c6388b58) | 确认挂载阻塞导致持续重试 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 `1` (reason: `ContainerCreating`) (fact-c14607f245be) | 确认容器正处于创建等待阶段 |\n| 5 | K8s Config | kubernetes | 容器 `app` 内存限制 `32Mi` (fact-36276843cd86)、CPU 限制 `50m` (fact-75c23db3d030) | 排除资源超限导致 OOM/Kill |\n| 6 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total` 值为 `0` (fact-e794b26e1751) | 确认容器从未成功运行过 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\nK8s 事件 (fact-5d6b4ddbd710) 直接给出了错误原因，Metric 状态 (fact-c14607f245be) 与事件中的挂载失败原因一致。配置信息排除了因资源不足被驱逐的可能，重启计数为 0 说明 Pod 尚未到达容器启动阶段，完全符合 `ContainerCreating` 的等待现象。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 缺失 → Pod 挂载卷 'input' (Optional: false) 失败 → kubelet MountVolume.SetUp 报错 → 容器处于 ContainerCreating 等待状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是：Pod `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz` 定义了一个名为 `input` 的卷，该卷引用 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，且未设置 `Optional: true`。由于该 ConfigMap 在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间中不存在，kubelet 无法完成挂载操作 (fact-5d6b4ddbd710)，导致 Pod 永久卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态 (fact-c14607f245be, fact-ee00c6388b58)。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 36.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 33.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz: 33.2s (Evidence 23.8s, RCA 9.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.1s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-2xgjz**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 80.106, "metrics": {"run_id": "18aa4bf956524d4f", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 80.11215925216675, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "47%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 80112.15925216675, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 76394.53268051147, "tool_calls": 10, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 10, "failed_tool_calls":